SecureSPF is a high-performance RFC 7208 SPF (Sender Policy Framework)
verification milter written in Zig. It integrates with Postfix via the
milter protocol (v6) to add Authentication-Results headers indicating
SPF pass/fail/temperror/permerror status.

Features:
- All 8 SPF mechanisms (all, ip4, ip6, a, mx, include, exists, ptr)
- RFC 7208 macro expansion (%{s/l/o/d/i/p/h/c/r/t/v})
- 10-DNS-lookup limit enforcement
- redirect modifier support
- IPv4 and IPv6 CIDR matching
- Trusted hosts whitelist
- Thread-per-core worker pool with kqueue I/O multiplexing
- INI-style configuration
